  "create_biotech.ponder.creeper_blast_chamber_s_10040.text_5": "除了顶面和底面的任意面中心可以被替换为防爆玻璃",
  "create_biotech.ponder.creeper_blast_chamber_s_10040.text_6": "除此之外，每个结构还必须包括一个爆破室核心",
  "create_biotech.ponder.creeper_blast_chamber_s_10040.text_7": "以及两个任意大小的防爆保险库（连接的保险库算做一个）",
  "create_biotech.ponder.creeper_blast_chamber_s_10040.text_8": "结构成型以后，顶面的棱会被自动替换为链式传动箱",
  "create_biotech.ponder.creeper_blast_chamber_s_10040.text_9": "使用扳手可以在机壳和传动箱之间切换，但是需要保证能够剩下的传动箱足以驱动所有冲压机",
  "create_biotech.ponder.creeper_blast_chamber_s_2c227.header": "苦力怕爆破室 过载",
  "create_biotech.ponder.creeper_blast_chamber_s_2c227.text_1": "苦力怕爆破室最高接受128rpm的转速",
  "create_biotech.ponder.creeper_blast_chamber_s_2c227.text_2": "超过128rpm的转速会使其进入过载状态",
  "create_biotech.ponder.creeper_blast_chamber_s_2c227.text_3": "不要长时间过载，除非你想引起一次足以炸毁你基地的大爆炸！",
  "create_biotech.ponder.creeper_blast_chamber_s_a77f7.header": "苦力怕爆破室 高压聚爆",
  "create_biotech.ponder.creeper_blast_chamber_s_a77f7.text_1": "向爆破室中输入高压苦力怕...",
  "create_biotech.ponder.creeper_blast_chamber_s_a77f7.text_2": "可以将配方调整为“高压聚爆”模式",
  "create_biotech.ponder.creeper_blast_chamber_s_a77f7.text_3": "“高压聚爆”模式有单独的配方，不再执行粉碎配方",
  "create_biotech.ponder.creeper_blast_chamber_s_a77f7.text_4": "当然，过载引起的爆炸烈度也会成倍增加",
  "create_biotech.ponder.creeper_blast_chamber_s_c38b1.header": "苦力怕爆破室 运作",
  "create_biotech.ponder.creeper_blast_chamber_s_c38b1.text_1": "爆炸室核心可以通过纸箱输入和输出苦力怕",
  "create_biotech.ponder.creeper_blast_chamber_s_c38b1.text_2": "最大的爆破室最多可以有9个苦力怕同时工作",
  "create_biotech.ponder.creeper_blast_chamber_s_c38b1.text_3": "通入应力...",
  "create_biotech.ponder.creeper_blast_chamber_s_c38b1.text_4": "每有一只苦力怕，爆破室就会提取输入保险库中的一组物品，执行粉碎轮的粉碎配方，输出到输出保险库",
  "create_biotech.ponder.creeper_blast_chamber_s_c38b1.text_5": "右键长按保险库可以调整其为输入或输出",
  "create_biotech.ponder.creeper_blast_chamber_scene_1.header": "苦力怕爆破室 介绍",
  "create_biotech.ponder.creeper_blast_chamber_scene_1.text_1": "这是一个苦力怕爆破室",
  "create_biotech.ponder.creeper_blast_chamber_scene_1.text_2": "它可以高效批量地执行粉碎配方",
  "create_biotech.ponder.creeper_blast_chamber_scene_1.text_3": "或者...你想来点更劲爆的？",
  "create_biotech.ponder.bone_ratchet.header": "骨制棘轮",
  "create_biotech.ponder.bone_ratchet.text_1": "骨质棘轮只接受一种方向的旋转",
  "create_biotech.ponder.bone_ratchet.text_2": "接受反方向应力时，他会卡死整个应力网络",
  "create_biotech.ponder.evoker_enchanting_chamber_s_8911d.header": "唤魔者附魔室",
  "create_biotech.ponder.evoker_enchanting_chamber_s_8911d.text_1": "这是唤魔者附魔室",
  "create_biotech.ponder.evoker_enchanting_chamber_s_8911d.text_2": "它可以将附魔书（复印本）附魔为可以使用的附魔书",
  "create_biotech.ponder.evoker_enchanting_chamber_s_8911d.text_3": "通过经验泵向其输送附魔所需要的经验",
  "create_biotech.ponder.evoker_enchanting_chamber_s_8911d.text_4": "附魔书的总等级越高，所需的经验越多，时间越长",
  "create_biotech.ponder.evoker_enchanting_chamber_scene_1.header": "鱿鱼打印机",
  "create_biotech.ponder.evoker_enchanting_chamber_scene_1.text_1": "这是一个简单的附魔流水线",
  "create_biotech.ponder.evoker_enchanting_chamber_scene_1.text_2": "这是鱿鱼打印机",
  "create_biotech.ponder.evoker_enchanting_chamber_scene_1.text_3": "在侧面标记一本附魔书...",
  "create_biotech.ponder.evoker_enchanting_chamber_scene_1.text_4": "它会将下方的书加工为附魔书（复印本）",
  "create_biotech.ponder.evoker_enchanting_chamber_scene_1.text_5": "无论是否在工作，打印机都需要输入水来保证鱿鱼存活",
  "create_biotech.ponder.magma_belt_connector.header": "岩浆怪传送带",
  "create_biotech.ponder.magma_belt_connector.text_1": "使用鼓风机烧炼物品比较占空间",
  "create_biotech.ponder.magma_belt_connector.text_2": "使用岩浆怪传送带",
  "create_biotech.ponder.magma_belt_connector.text_3": "它会自动烧炼其上方的物品，所需时间与鼓风机相同",
  "create_biotech.ponder.magma_belt_connector.text_4": "它没有鼓风机的烧炼保护，记得在它被第二次燃烧前把它取走！",
  "create_biotech.ponder.slime_clutch.header": "史莱姆离合器",
  "create_biotech.ponder.slime_clutch.text_1": "史莱姆离合器会在输入应力不支持驱动整个应力网络时自动断开，而不影响网络的其他部分",
  "create_biotech.ponder.slime_clutch.text_2": "并在应力充足时自动恢复",
  "create_biotech.ponder.squid_printer_s_8911d.header": "唤魔者附魔室",
  "create_biotech.ponder.squid_printer_s_8911d.text_1": "这是唤魔者附魔室",
  "create_biotech.ponder.squid_printer_s_8911d.text_2": "它可以将附魔书（复印本）附魔为可以使用的附魔书",
  "create_biotech.ponder.squid_printer_s_8911d.text_3": "通过经验泵向其输送附魔所需要的经验",
  "create_biotech.ponder.squid_printer_s_8911d.text_4": "附魔书的总等级越高，所需的经验越多，时间越长",
  "create_biotech.ponder.squid_printer_scene_1.header": "鱿鱼打印机",
  "create_biotech.ponder.squid_printer_scene_1.text_1": "这是一个简单的附魔流水线",
  "create_biotech.ponder.squid_printer_scene_1.text_2": "这是鱿鱼打印机",
  "create_biotech.ponder.squid_printer_scene_1.text_3": "在侧面标记一本附魔书...",
  "create_biotech.ponder.squid_printer_scene_1.text_4": "它会将下方的书加工为附魔书（复印本）",
  "create_biotech.ponder.squid_printer_scene_1.text_5": "无论是否在工作，打印机都需要输入水来保证鱿鱼存活",
  "create_biotech.ponder.universal_joint.header": "史莱姆万向节",
  "create_biotech.ponder.universal_joint.text_1": "史莱姆万向节可以在相近的任意两个点之间传播应力",
  "create_biotech.ponder.universal_joint.text_2": "另一节点必须位于连接范围内。结构移动会拉伸轴体；接近极限时逐渐变为史莱姆离合器的过载色，过度拉伸后断裂。",
  "create_biotech.ponder.experience_pump_s_40666.header": "经验泵 输出",
  "create_biotech.ponder.experience_pump_s_40666.text_1": "输出端会向兼容的流体端点提供经验",
  "create_biotech.ponder.experience_pump_s_40666.text_2": "也可以把经验输出到普通流体储罐或其他流体容器",
  "create_biotech.ponder.experience_pump_s_40666.text_3": "输出端不能直接将经验转化为物品",
  "create_biotech.ponder.experience_pump_s_40666.text_4": "你需要将经验通入经验母岩...",
  "create_biotech.ponder.experience_pump_s_40666.text_5": "催化成熟的经验簇会自然掉落，它存储的经验值远高于经验颗粒",
  "create_biotech.ponder.experience_pump_scene_1.header": "经验泵 输入",
  "create_biotech.ponder.experience_pump_scene_1.text_1": "经验泵可以用于在泵两端传递经验",
  "create_biotech.ponder.experience_pump_scene_1.text_2": "输入端接受多种形式的经验",
  "create_biotech.ponder.experience_pump_scene_1.text_3": "经验球...",
  "create_biotech.ponder.experience_pump_scene_1.text_4": "储罐或流体管道中的经验...",
  "create_biotech.ponder.experience_pump_scene_1.text_5": "装有经验物品的储物方块...",
  "create_biotech.ponder.experience_pump_scene_1.text_6": "或者玩家",
  "create_biotech.ponder.experience_pump_scene_1.text_7": "在输入端安装分散网，可以吸引更远范围的经验球",
  "create_biotech.ponder.schrodingers_cat.header": "薛定谔的猫",
  "create_biotech.ponder.schrodingers_cat.text_1": "薛定谔的猫会在其背后随机输出红石信号",
  "create_biotech.ponder.schrodingers_cat.text_2": "其间隔时间和输出模式（持续信号/脉冲信号）可以在侧面配置",
  "create_biotech.ponder.slime_belt_connector.header": "史莱姆传送带",
  "create_biotech.ponder.slime_belt_connector.text_1": "史莱姆传送带可以像一般传送带一样传输物品",
  "create_biotech.ponder.slime_belt_connector.text_2": "不同的是，物品不会在传送带末端被抛出，而是会继续运动到传送带背面",
  "create_biotech.ponder.slime_belt_connector.text_3": "史莱姆传送带还可以竖直传动物品",
  "create_biotech.ponder.slime_belt_connector.text_4": "相连的史莱姆传送带可以形成一个回环",
  "create_biotech.ponder.spider_assembly_table.header": "蜘蛛装配站",
  "create_biotech.ponder.spider_assembly_table.text_1": "蜘蛛装配台可以执行序列装配配方",
  "create_biotech.ponder.spider_assembly_table.text_2": "右键打开界面，在第一行放入装配所需要的机器...",
  "create_biotech.ponder.spider_assembly_table.text_3": "在第二行放入装配所需原料",
  "create_biotech.ponder.spider_assembly_table.text_4": "装配！",
  "create_biotech.ponder.bio_packager_s_fe8b2.header": "生物打包机 捕捉",
  "create_biotech.ponder.bio_packager_s_fe8b2.text_1": "生物打包机会自动提取附着库存中的纸箱，并捕捉被动态结构杀死的生物",
  "create_biotech.ponder.bio_packager_scene_1.header": "生物打包机 释放",
  "create_biotech.ponder.bio_packager_scene_1.text_1": "接入红石信号...",
  "create_biotech.ponder.bio_packager_scene_1.text_2": "生物打包机会从其附着的库存中提取装有生物的纸箱并释放到其上方",
  "create_biotech.ponder.power_belt_connector.header": "动力传送带",
  "create_biotech.ponder.power_belt_connector.text_1": "动力传送带会在有生物在其上方运动时产生应力",
  "create_biotech.ponder.power_belt_connector.text_2": "上方生物运动的越快，产生的转速越高，应力越高",
  "create_biotech.ponder.power_belt_connector.text_3": "多个实体产生的应力会叠加，但是转速不会",
  "create_biotech.ponder.power_belt_connector.text_4": "使用固定的钓竿，让动物为你工作",
  "create_biotech.ponder.ghast_helm_s_29671.header": "恶魂热气球装配站 操纵",
  "create_biotech.ponder.ghast_helm_s_29671.text_1": "使用恶魂驾驶台来操控恶魂热气球",
  "create_biotech.ponder.ghast_helm_s_29671.text_2": "W/S 前后移动",
  "create_biotech.ponder.ghast_helm_s_29671.text_3": "A/D 左右转弯",
  "create_biotech.ponder.ghast_helm_s_29671.text_4": "空格/Shift 上下移动",
  "create_biotech.ponder.ghast_helm_s_29671.text_5": "Ctrl 停止操控",
  "create_biotech.ponder.ghast_helm_s_29671.text_6": "Alt 自动靠近附近未充能的装配站",
  "create_biotech.ponder.ghast_helm_scene_1.header": "恶魂热气球装配站 组装",
  "create_biotech.ponder.ghast_helm_scene_1.text_1": "使用恶魂热气球装配站来组装你的恶魂热气球",
  "create_biotech.ponder.ghast_helm_scene_1.text_2": "使用强力胶粘合你的热气球",
  "create_biotech.ponder.ghast_helm_scene_1.text_3": "使用缓冲垫可以防止结构陷入地下",
  "create_biotech.ponder.ghast_helm_scene_1.text_4": "然后为热气球装配站接入红石...",
  "create_biotech.ponder.ghast_helm_scene_1.text_5": "再在装配站上方放一只恶魂...",
  "create_biotech.ponder.ghast_helm_scene_1.text_6": "组装完成！",
  "create_biotech.ponder.ghast_helm_scene_1.text_7": "靠近未充能的装配站或对绳索使用剪刀可以使结构解体",
  "create_biotech.ponder.ghast_hot_air_balloon_assembly_station_s_29671.header": "恶魂热气球装配站 操纵",
  "create_biotech.ponder.ghast_hot_air_balloon_assembly_station_s_29671.text_1": "使用恶魂驾驶台来操控恶魂热气球",
  "create_biotech.ponder.ghast_hot_air_balloon_assembly_station_s_29671.text_2": "W/S 前后移动",
  "create_biotech.ponder.ghast_hot_air_balloon_assembly_station_s_29671.text_3": "A/D 左右转弯",
  "create_biotech.ponder.ghast_hot_air_balloon_assembly_station_s_29671.text_4": "空格/Shift 上下移动",
  "create_biotech.ponder.ghast_hot_air_balloon_assembly_station_s_29671.text_5": "Ctrl 停止操控",
  "create_biotech.ponder.ghast_hot_air_balloon_assembly_station_s_29671.text_6": "Alt 自动靠近附近未充能的装配站",
  "create_biotech.ponder.ghast_hot_air_balloon_assembly_station_scene_1.header": "恶魂热气球装配站 组装",
  "create_biotech.ponder.ghast_hot_air_balloon_assembly_station_scene_1.text_1": "使用恶魂热气球装配站来组装你的恶魂热气球",
  "create_biotech.ponder.ghast_hot_air_balloon_assembly_station_scene_1.text_2": "使用强力胶粘合你的热气球",
  "create_biotech.ponder.ghast_hot_air_balloon_assembly_station_scene_1.text_3": "使用缓冲垫可以防止结构陷入地下",
  "create_biotech.ponder.ghast_hot_air_balloon_assembly_station_scene_1.text_4": "然后为热气球装配站接入红石...",
  "create_biotech.ponder.ghast_hot_air_balloon_assembly_station_scene_1.text_5": "再在装配站上方放一只恶魂...",
  "create_biotech.ponder.ghast_hot_air_balloon_assembly_station_scene_1.text_6": "组装完成！",
  "create_biotech.ponder.ghast_hot_air_balloon_assembly_station_scene_1.text_7": "靠近未充能的装配站或对绳索使用剪刀可以使结构解体",
