  "config.jade.plugin_create_biotech.butter_cat_engine": "黄油猫引擎信息",
  "create_biotech.ponder.butter_cat_engine.header": "让黄油猫转起来！",
  "create_biotech.ponder.butter_cat_engine.text_1": "拿着装有猫的纸箱对传动杆使用。",
  "create_biotech.ponder.butter_cat_engine.text_2": "先把它变成趴在传动杆上的可爱猫猫，再放上一片面包和一些黄油吧。",
  "create_biotech.ponder.butter_cat_engine.text_3": "黄油越多，它提供的应力和转速就越高。",
